            "type": "codeBlock",
            "language": "",
            "code": "git clone https://github.com/morpe/opaleuclasio.git\ncd opaleuclasio\n\n### 2. Convert a Markdown file to JSON (Opale)\n```bash\nphp opale.php my-note.md > my-note.json\n````\n\nOr pipe from stdin:\n\n```bash\ncat my-note.md | php opale.php > my-note.json"
